       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. HP-CLAIMS-KNOWLEDGE-TEST.
       AUTHOR. MICROSOFT COPILOT SYNTHETIC GENERATOR.
      * ================================================================
      * SYNTHETIC COBOL CLAIMS PROCESSING PROGRAM FOR KNOWLEDGE EXTRACTION
      * DOMAIN: HEALTH PAYER CLAIMS ADJUDICATION / BENEFITS / PRICING
      * PURPOSE: TEST AGENT ABILITY TO EXTRACT RULES, DATA FLOWS, AND TERMS
      * NOTE: THIS IS NOT PRODUCTION CODE AND CONTAINS NO REAL MEMBER DATA.
      * ================================================================
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-Z-SYNTHETIC.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-Z-SYNTHETIC.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT CLAIM-IN-FILE ASSIGN TO CLMIN
              ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
           SELECT CLAIM-OUT-FILE ASSIGN TO CLMOUT
              ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
           SELECT DENIAL-RPT-FILE ASSIGN TO DENRPT
              ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
           SELECT AUDIT-TRAIL-FILE ASSIGN TO AUDTRL
              ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  CLAIM-IN-FILE.
       01  CLAIM-IN-REC                 PIC X(420).
       FD  CLAIM-OUT-FILE.
       01  CLAIM-OUT-REC                PIC X(620).
       FD  DENIAL-RPT-FILE.
       01  DENIAL-RPT-REC               PIC X(420).
       FD  AUDIT-TRAIL-FILE.
       01  AUDIT-TRAIL-REC              PIC X(620).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  WS-PROGRAM-NAME              PIC X(32) VALUE 'HP-CLAIMS-KNOWLEDGE-TEST'.
       77  WS-EOF-SW                    PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       77  WS-CLAIMS-READ               PIC 9(9) VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-CLAIMS-PAID               PIC 9(9) VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-CLAIMS-DENIED             PIC 9(9) VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-CLAIMS-PENDED             PIC 9(9) VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-TRACE-LEVEL               PIC 9 VALUE 2.
       77  WS-RUN-DATE                  PIC 9(8) VALUE 20260811.
       77  WS-RUN-TIME                  PIC 9(6) VALUE 154002.
       77  WS-RETURN-CODE               PIC 9(4) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-CLAIM.
           05 WS-CLAIM-ID               PIC X(18).
           05 WS-MEMBER-ID              PIC X(18).
           05 WS-GROUP-ID               PIC X(12).
           05 WS-PRODUCT-CD             PIC X(06).
           05 WS-LOB                    PIC X(04).
           05 WS-PROVIDER-ID            PIC X(15).
           05 WS-BILLING-NPI            PIC X(10).
           05 WS-RENDERING-NPI          PIC X(10).
           05 WS-CLAIM-TYPE             PIC X(02).
           05 WS-PLACE-OF-SERVICE       PIC X(02).
           05 WS-DIAGNOSIS-CD           PIC X(08).
           05 WS-PROCEDURE-CD           PIC X(08).
           05 WS-REVENUE-CD             PIC X(04).
           05 WS-MODIFIER-1             PIC X(02).
           05 WS-MODIFIER-2             PIC X(02).
           05 WS-DATE-OF-SERVICE        PIC 9(8).
           05 WS-RECEIVED-DATE          PIC 9(8).
           05 WS-BILLED-AMT             PIC 9(9)V99.
           05 WS-ALLOWED-AMT            PIC 9(9)V99.
           05 WS-COPAY-AMT              PIC 9(7)V99.
           05 WS-COINS-AMT              PIC 9(7)V99.
           05 WS-DEDUCT-AMT             PIC 9(7)V99.
           05 WS-PAID-AMT               PIC 9(9)V99.
           05 WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS    PIC X(01).
           05 WS-DENIAL-CODE            PIC X(05).
           05 WS-PEND-REASON            PIC X(05).
       01  WS-ACCUMULATORS.
           05 WS-FAMILY-DED-MET         PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
           05 WS-MEMBER-DED-MET         PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
           05 WS-FAMILY-OOP-MET         PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
           05 WS-MEMBER-OOP-MET         PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
           05 WS-BENEFIT-MAX-MET        PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-RULE-FLAGS.
           05 WS-ELIGIBLE-FLAG          PIC X VALUE 'N'.
           05 WS-COVERED-SERVICE-FLAG   PIC X VALUE 'N'.
           05 WS-AUTH-REQUIRED-FLAG     PIC X VALUE 'N'.
           05 WS-AUTH-FOUND-FLAG        PIC X VALUE 'N'.
           05 WS-NETWORK-FLAG           PIC X VALUE 'N'.
           05 WS-COB-FLAG               PIC X VALUE 'N'.
           05 WS-DUPLICATE-FLAG         PIC X VALUE 'N'.
           05 WS-FRAUD-RISK-FLAG        PIC X VALUE 'N'.
           05 WS-MANUAL-REVIEW-FLAG     PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       01  WS-MESSAGE-TEXT              PIC X(250).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAINLINE.
           PERFORM 0100-INITIALIZE.
           PERFORM 1000-PROCESS-CLAIMS UNTIL WS-EOF-SW = 'Y'.
           PERFORM 9000-FINALIZE.
           GOBACK.
       0100-INITIALIZE.
           OPEN INPUT CLAIM-IN-FILE
                OUTPUT CLAIM-OUT-FILE
                       DENIAL-RPT-FILE
                       AUDIT-TRAIL-FILE.
           MOVE 'CLAIMS RUN STARTED' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT.
           PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT.
           PERFORM 1100-READ-CLAIM.
       1000-PROCESS-CLAIMS.
           ADD 1 TO WS-CLAIMS-READ.
           PERFORM 1200-PARSE-CLAIM.
           PERFORM 2000-VALIDATE-ELIGIBILITY.
           PERFORM 3000-APPLY-BENEFIT-RULES.
           PERFORM 4000-PRICE-CLAIM.
           PERFORM 5000-APPLY-MEMBER-LIABILITY.
           PERFORM 6000-COORDINATION-OF-BENEFITS.
           PERFORM 7000-FINAL-ADJUDICATION.
           PERFORM 8000-WRITE-OUTPUT.
           PERFORM 1100-READ-CLAIM.
       1100-READ-CLAIM.
           READ CLAIM-IN-FILE
                AT END MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF-SW
                NOT AT END CONTINUE
           END-READ.
       1200-PARSE-CLAIM.
           MOVE CLAIM-IN-REC(001:018) TO WS-CLAIM-ID.
           MOVE CLAIM-IN-REC(019:018) TO WS-MEMBER-ID.
           MOVE CLAIM-IN-REC(037:012) TO WS-GROUP-ID.
           MOVE CLAIM-IN-REC(049:006) TO WS-PRODUCT-CD.
           MOVE CLAIM-IN-REC(055:004) TO WS-LOB.
           MOVE CLAIM-IN-REC(059:015) TO WS-PROVIDER-ID.
           MOVE CLAIM-IN-REC(074:010) TO WS-BILLING-NPI.
           MOVE CLAIM-IN-REC(084:010) TO WS-RENDERING-NPI.
           MOVE CLAIM-IN-REC(094:002) TO WS-CLAIM-TYPE.
           MOVE CLAIM-IN-REC(096:002) TO WS-PLACE-OF-SERVICE.
           MOVE CLAIM-IN-REC(098:008) TO WS-DIAGNOSIS-CD.
           MOVE CLAIM-IN-REC(106:008) TO WS-PROCEDURE-CD.
           MOVE CLAIM-IN-REC(114:004) TO WS-REVENUE-CD.
           MOVE CLAIM-IN-REC(118:002) TO WS-MODIFIER-1.
           MOVE CLAIM-IN-REC(120:002) TO WS-MODIFIER-2.
           MOVE CLAIM-IN-REC(122:008) TO WS-DATE-OF-SERVICE.
           MOVE CLAIM-IN-REC(130:008) TO WS-RECEIVED-DATE.
           MOVE CLAIM-IN-REC(138:011) TO WS-BILLED-AMT.
           MOVE 'N' TO WS-ELIGIBLE-FLAG WS-COVERED-SERVICE-FLAG
                       WS-AUTH-FOUND-FLAG WS-DUPLICATE-FLAG
                       WS-FRAUD-RISK-FLAG WS-MANUAL-REVIEW-FLAG.
       2000-VALIDATE-ELIGIBILITY.
           IF WS-MEMBER-ID = SPACES
              MOVE 'D' TO WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS
              MOVE 'M001' TO WS-DENIAL-CODE
              MOVE 'MISSING MEMBER IDENTIFIER' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT
              PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT
           ELSE
              MOVE 'Y' TO WS-ELIGIBLE-FLAG
              PERFORM 2100-CHECK-COVERAGE-DATES
              PERFORM 2200-CHECK-PRODUCT-ELIGIBILITY
              PERFORM 2300-CHECK-GROUP-STATUS
           END-IF.
       2100-CHECK-COVERAGE-DATES.
           IF WS-DATE-OF-SERVICE < 20200101
              MOVE 'D' TO WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS
              MOVE 'E101' TO WS-DENIAL-CODE
              MOVE 'SERVICE DATE PRIOR TO COVERAGE WINDOW' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT
              PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT
           END-IF.
       2200-CHECK-PRODUCT-ELIGIBILITY.
           EVALUATE WS-PRODUCT-CD
              WHEN 'PPO001' MOVE 'Y' TO WS-NETWORK-FLAG
              WHEN 'HMO001' MOVE 'Y' TO WS-NETWORK-FLAG
              WHEN 'MCR001' MOVE 'Y' TO WS-NETWORK-FLAG
              WHEN OTHER
                 MOVE 'P' TO WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS
                 MOVE 'P201' TO WS-PEND-REASON
                 MOVE 'UNKNOWN PRODUCT CODE REQUIRES REVIEW' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT
                 PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT
           END-EVALUATE.
       2300-CHECK-GROUP-STATUS.
           IF WS-GROUP-ID = 'TERMINATED  '
              MOVE 'D' TO WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS
              MOVE 'G301' TO WS-DENIAL-CODE
              MOVE 'GROUP IS TERMINATED' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT
              PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT
           END-IF.
       3000-APPLY-BENEFIT-RULES.
           IF WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS NOT = 'D'
              PERFORM 3100-CHECK-COVERED-SERVICE
              PERFORM 3200-CHECK-PRIOR-AUTHORIZATION
              PERFORM 3300-CHECK-BENEFIT-MAXIMUM
              PERFORM 3400-CHECK-DUPLICATE-CLAIM
              PERFORM 3500-CHECK-FRAUD-RISK
           END-IF.
       3100-CHECK-COVERED-SERVICE.
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN WS-PROCEDURE-CD = '99385   ' MOVE 'Y' TO WS-COVERED-SERVICE-FLAG
              WHEN WS-PROCEDURE-CD = '99213   ' MOVE 'Y' TO WS-COVERED-SERVICE-FLAG
              WHEN WS-PROCEDURE-CD = '93000   ' MOVE 'Y' TO WS-COVERED-SERVICE-FLAG
              WHEN WS-REVENUE-CD = '0450' MOVE 'Y' TO WS-COVERED-SERVICE-FLAG
              WHEN OTHER
                 MOVE 'D' TO WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS
                 MOVE 'B401' TO WS-DENIAL-CODE
                 MOVE 'SERVICE NOT COVERED BY BENEFIT PLAN' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT
                 PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT
           END-EVALUATE.
       3200-CHECK-PRIOR-AUTHORIZATION.
           IF WS-PROCEDURE-CD = '70553   ' OR WS-REVENUE-CD = '0360'
              MOVE 'Y' TO WS-AUTH-REQUIRED-FLAG
              IF WS-AUTH-FOUND-FLAG NOT = 'Y'
                 MOVE 'P' TO WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS
                 MOVE 'A501' TO WS-PEND-REASON
                 MOVE 'PRIOR AUTHORIZATION REQUIRED' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT
                 PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT
              END-IF
           END-IF.
       3300-CHECK-BENEFIT-MAXIMUM.
           IF WS-BENEFIT-MAX-MET > 999999.99
              MOVE 'D' TO WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS
              MOVE 'B601' TO WS-DENIAL-CODE
              MOVE 'BENEFIT MAXIMUM EXCEEDED' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT
              PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT
           END-IF.
       3400-CHECK-DUPLICATE-CLAIM.
           IF WS-DUPLICATE-FLAG = 'Y'
              MOVE 'D' TO WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS
              MOVE 'D701' TO WS-DENIAL-CODE
              MOVE 'POTENTIAL DUPLICATE CLAIM' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT
              PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT
           END-IF.
       3500-CHECK-FRAUD-RISK.
           IF WS-BILLED-AMT > 50000.00
              MOVE 'P' TO WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS
              MOVE 'F801' TO WS-PEND-REASON
              MOVE 'HIGH DOLLAR CLAIM REQUIRES SIU REVIEW' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT
              MOVE 'Y' TO WS-FRAUD-RISK-FLAG
              PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT
           END-IF.
       4000-PRICE-CLAIM.
           IF WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS NOT = 'D'
              COMPUTE WS-ALLOWED-AMT = WS-BILLED-AMT * 0.6200
              IF WS-NETWORK-FLAG = 'N'
                 COMPUTE WS-ALLOWED-AMT = WS-BILLED-AMT * 0.4200
              END-IF
              PERFORM 4100-APPLY-FEE-SCHEDULE
              PERFORM 4200-APPLY-PROVIDER-CONTRACT
           END-IF.
       4100-APPLY-FEE-SCHEDULE.
           EVALUATE WS-PLACE-OF-SERVICE
              WHEN '11' COMPUTE WS-ALLOWED-AMT = WS-ALLOWED-AMT * 1.0000
              WHEN '22' COMPUTE WS-ALLOWED-AMT = WS-ALLOWED-AMT * 1.1000
              WHEN '23' COMPUTE WS-ALLOWED-AMT = WS-ALLOWED-AMT * 1.2500
              WHEN OTHER COMPUTE WS-ALLOWED-AMT = WS-ALLOWED-AMT * 0.9500
           END-EVALUATE.
       4200-APPLY-PROVIDER-CONTRACT.
           IF WS-PROVIDER-ID(1:3) = 'PAR'
              COMPUTE WS-ALLOWED-AMT = WS-ALLOWED-AMT * 0.9700
           ELSE
              COMPUTE WS-ALLOWED-AMT = WS-ALLOWED-AMT * 0.8500
           END-IF.
       5000-APPLY-MEMBER-LIABILITY.
           IF WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS NOT = 'D'
              PERFORM 5100-APPLY-DEDUCTIBLE
              PERFORM 5200-APPLY-COPAY
              PERFORM 5300-APPLY-COINSURANCE
              COMPUTE WS-PAID-AMT = WS-ALLOWED-AMT - WS-DEDUCT-AMT - WS-COPAY-AMT - WS-COINS-AMT
              IF WS-PAID-AMT < 0 MOVE 0 TO WS-PAID-AMT END-IF
           END-IF.
       5100-APPLY-DEDUCTIBLE.
           IF WS-MEMBER-DED-MET < 1500.00
              COMPUTE WS-DEDUCT-AMT = FUNCTION MIN(WS-ALLOWED-AMT, 1500.00 - WS-MEMBER-DED-MET)
           ELSE
              MOVE 0 TO WS-DEDUCT-AMT
           END-IF.
       5200-APPLY-COPAY.
           EVALUATE WS-PLACE-OF-SERVICE
              WHEN '11' MOVE 25.00 TO WS-COPAY-AMT
              WHEN '23' MOVE 150.00 TO WS-COPAY-AMT
              WHEN OTHER MOVE 0 TO WS-COPAY-AMT
           END-EVALUATE.
       5300-APPLY-COINSURANCE.
           COMPUTE WS-COINS-AMT = (WS-ALLOWED-AMT - WS-DEDUCT-AMT - WS-COPAY-AMT) * 0.2000
           IF WS-MEMBER-OOP-MET > 7000.00
              MOVE 0 TO WS-COINS-AMT
           END-IF.
       6000-COORDINATION-OF-BENEFITS.
           IF WS-COB-FLAG = 'Y' AND WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS NOT = 'D'
              COMPUTE WS-PAID-AMT = WS-PAID-AMT * 0.5000
              MOVE 'COB SECONDARY PAYMENT APPLIED' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT
              PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT
           END-IF.
       7000-FINAL-ADJUDICATION.
           EVALUATE WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS
              WHEN 'D' ADD 1 TO WS-CLAIMS-DENIED
              WHEN 'P' ADD 1 TO WS-CLAIMS-PENDED
              WHEN OTHER
                 MOVE 'A' TO WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS
                 ADD 1 TO WS-CLAIMS-PAID
           END-EVALUATE.
       8000-WRITE-OUTPUT.
           STRING WS-CLAIM-ID DELIMITED BY SIZE '|' DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  WS-MEMBER-ID DELIMITED BY SIZE '|' DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS DELIMITED BY SIZE '|' DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  WS-DENIAL-CODE DELIMITED BY SIZE '|' DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  WS-PEND-REASON DELIMITED BY SIZE '|' DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  WS-PAID-AMT DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  INTO CLAIM-OUT-REC
           END-STRING.
           WRITE CLAIM-OUT-REC.
           IF WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS = 'D'
              PERFORM 8100-WRITE-DENIAL-REPORT
           END-IF.
       8100-WRITE-DENIAL-REPORT.
           STRING WS-CLAIM-ID DELIMITED BY SIZE '|' DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  WS-DENIAL-CODE DELIMITED BY SIZE '|' DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  WS-MESSAGE-TEXT DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  INTO DENIAL-RPT-REC
           END-STRING.
           WRITE DENIAL-RPT-REC.
       8800-WRITE-AUDIT.
           STRING WS-RUN-DATE DELIMITED BY SIZE '|' DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  WS-RUN-TIME DELIMITED BY SIZE '|' DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  WS-CLAIM-ID DELIMITED BY SIZE '|' DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  WS-MESSAGE-TEXT DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  INTO AUDIT-TRAIL-REC
           END-STRING.
           WRITE AUDIT-TRAIL-REC.
       9000-FINALIZE.
           MOVE 'CLAIMS RUN COMPLETED' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT.
           PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT.
           CLOSE CLAIM-IN-FILE CLAIM-OUT-FILE DENIAL-RPT-FILE AUDIT-TRAIL-FILE.
           DISPLAY 'CLAIMS READ: ' WS-CLAIMS-READ.
           DISPLAY 'CLAIMS PAID: ' WS-CLAIMS-PAID.
           DISPLAY 'CLAIMS DENIED: ' WS-CLAIMS-DENIED.
           DISPLAY 'CLAIMS PENDED: ' WS-CLAIMS-PENDED.
       ELIG-00001-ELIGIBILITY-RULE.
      * RULE ELIG-00001: VALIDATE MEMBER COVERAGE AND PRODUCT ENROLLMENT.
      * KNOWLEDGE TAG: DOMAIN=ELIGIBILITY CLAIM-TYPE=PROFESSIONAL INSTITUTIONAL PHARMACY.
      * INPUTS: MEMBER, GROUP, PRODUCT, PROVIDER, CLAIM LINE, SERVICE DATE, AMOUNTS.
      * OUTPUTS: STATUS, DENIAL-CODE, PEND-REASON, ALLOWED, PAID, AUDIT MESSAGE.
           IF WS-ELIGIBLE-FLAG NOT = 'Y'
              MOVE 'D' TO WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS
              MOVE 'E101' TO WS-DENIAL-CODE
              MOVE 'MEMBER NOT ELIGIBLE FOR DATE OF SERVICE' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT
              PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT
           END-IF.

       BNFT-00002-BENEFIT-RULE.
      * RULE BNFT-00002: APPLY BENEFIT LIMITS, COVERED SERVICES, AND EXCLUSIONS.
      * KNOWLEDGE TAG: DOMAIN=BENEFIT CLAIM-TYPE=PROFESSIONAL INSTITUTIONAL PHARMACY.
      * INPUTS: MEMBER, GROUP, PRODUCT, PROVIDER, CLAIM LINE, SERVICE DATE, AMOUNTS.
      * OUTPUTS: STATUS, DENIAL-CODE, PEND-REASON, ALLOWED, PAID, AUDIT MESSAGE.
           IF WS-COVERED-SERVICE-FLAG NOT = 'Y'
              MOVE 'D' TO WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS
              MOVE 'B102' TO WS-DENIAL-CODE
              MOVE 'BENEFIT EXCLUSION OR NON COVERED SERVICE' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT
              PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT
           END-IF.

       AUTH-00003-AUTHORIZATION-RULE.
      * RULE AUTH-00003: CHECK PRIOR AUTHORIZATION AND REFERRAL REQUIREMENTS.
      * KNOWLEDGE TAG: DOMAIN=AUTHORIZATION CLAIM-TYPE=PROFESSIONAL INSTITUTIONAL PHARMACY.
      * INPUTS: MEMBER, GROUP, PRODUCT, PROVIDER, CLAIM LINE, SERVICE DATE, AMOUNTS.
      * OUTPUTS: STATUS, DENIAL-CODE, PEND-REASON, ALLOWED, PAID, AUDIT MESSAGE.
           IF WS-AUTH-REQUIRED-FLAG = 'Y' AND WS-AUTH-FOUND-FLAG NOT = 'Y'
              MOVE 'P' TO WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS
              MOVE 'A103' TO WS-PEND-REASON
              MOVE 'AUTHORIZATION REVIEW REQUIRED BEFORE PAYMENT' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT
              PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT
           END-IF.

       PRIC-00004-PRICING-RULE.
      * RULE PRIC-00004: APPLY FEE SCHEDULE, CONTRACT, AND NETWORK DISCOUNT.
      * KNOWLEDGE TAG: DOMAIN=PRICING CLAIM-TYPE=PROFESSIONAL INSTITUTIONAL PHARMACY.
      * INPUTS: MEMBER, GROUP, PRODUCT, PROVIDER, CLAIM LINE, SERVICE DATE, AMOUNTS.
      * OUTPUTS: STATUS, DENIAL-CODE, PEND-REASON, ALLOWED, PAID, AUDIT MESSAGE.
           IF WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS NOT = 'D'
              COMPUTE WS-ALLOWED-AMT = WS-ALLOWED-AMT * 0.8400
              MOVE 'PRICING ADJUSTMENT APPLIED' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT
              PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT
           END-IF.

       LIAB-00005-LIABILITY-RULE.
      * RULE LIAB-00005: CALCULATE DEDUCTIBLE, COPAY, COINSURANCE, AND OOP.
      * KNOWLEDGE TAG: DOMAIN=LIABILITY CLAIM-TYPE=PROFESSIONAL INSTITUTIONAL PHARMACY.
      * INPUTS: MEMBER, GROUP, PRODUCT, PROVIDER, CLAIM LINE, SERVICE DATE, AMOUNTS.
      * OUTPUTS: STATUS, DENIAL-CODE, PEND-REASON, ALLOWED, PAID, AUDIT MESSAGE.
           IF WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS NOT = 'D'
              COMPUTE WS-COINS-AMT = WS-COINS-AMT + (WS-ALLOWED-AMT * 0.1500)
              IF WS-MEMBER-OOP-MET > 7000.00 MOVE 0 TO WS-COINS-AMT END-IF
              MOVE 'MEMBER LIABILITY RULE APPLIED' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT
              PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT
           END-IF.

       COB-00006-COORDINATION-RULE.
      * RULE COB-00006: COORDINATE BENEFITS WITH OTHER PAYER INFORMATION.
      * KNOWLEDGE TAG: DOMAIN=COORDINATION CLAIM-TYPE=PROFESSIONAL INSTITUTIONAL PHARMACY.
      * INPUTS: MEMBER, GROUP, PRODUCT, PROVIDER, CLAIM LINE, SERVICE DATE, AMOUNTS.
      * OUTPUTS: STATUS, DENIAL-CODE, PEND-REASON, ALLOWED, PAID, AUDIT MESSAGE.
           IF WS-COB-FLAG = 'Y'
              COMPUTE WS-PAID-AMT = WS-PAID-AMT * 0.5000
              MOVE 'SECONDARY PAYER COB REDUCTION APPLIED' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT
              PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT
           END-IF.

       QUAL-00007-QUALITY-RULE.
      * RULE QUAL-00007: APPLY QUALITY, EDIT, AND MEDICAL NECESSITY CHECKS.
      * KNOWLEDGE TAG: DOMAIN=QUALITY CLAIM-TYPE=PROFESSIONAL INSTITUTIONAL PHARMACY.
      * INPUTS: MEMBER, GROUP, PRODUCT, PROVIDER, CLAIM LINE, SERVICE DATE, AMOUNTS.
      * OUTPUTS: STATUS, DENIAL-CODE, PEND-REASON, ALLOWED, PAID, AUDIT MESSAGE.
           IF WS-DIAGNOSIS-CD = SPACES OR WS-PROCEDURE-CD = SPACES
              MOVE 'P' TO WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS
              MOVE 'Q107' TO WS-PEND-REASON
              MOVE 'CODING QUALITY REVIEW REQUIRED' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT
              PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT
           END-IF.

       RISK-00008-RISK-RULE.
      * RULE RISK-00008: IDENTIFY HIGH DOLLAR, DUPLICATE, AND SIU REVIEW SCENARIOS.
      * KNOWLEDGE TAG: DOMAIN=RISK CLAIM-TYPE=PROFESSIONAL INSTITUTIONAL PHARMACY.
      * INPUTS: MEMBER, GROUP, PRODUCT, PROVIDER, CLAIM LINE, SERVICE DATE, AMOUNTS.
      * OUTPUTS: STATUS, DENIAL-CODE, PEND-REASON, ALLOWED, PAID, AUDIT MESSAGE.
           IF WS-BILLED-AMT > 18000.00
              MOVE 'P' TO WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS
              MOVE 'R108' TO WS-PEND-REASON
              MOVE 'HIGH DOLLAR OR RISK BASED REVIEW TRIGGERED' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT
              PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT
           END-IF.

       ELIG-00009-ELIGIBILITY-RULE.
      * RULE ELIG-00009: VALIDATE MEMBER COVERAGE AND PRODUCT ENROLLMENT.
      * KNOWLEDGE TAG: DOMAIN=ELIGIBILITY CLAIM-TYPE=PROFESSIONAL INSTITUTIONAL PHARMACY.
      * INPUTS: MEMBER, GROUP, PRODUCT, PROVIDER, CLAIM LINE, SERVICE DATE, AMOUNTS.
      * OUTPUTS: STATUS, DENIAL-CODE, PEND-REASON, ALLOWED, PAID, AUDIT MESSAGE.
           IF WS-ELIGIBLE-FLAG NOT = 'Y'
              MOVE 'D' TO WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS
              MOVE 'E109' TO WS-DENIAL-CODE
              MOVE 'MEMBER NOT ELIGIBLE FOR DATE OF SERVICE' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT
              PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT
           END-IF.

       BNFT-00010-BENEFIT-RULE.
      * RULE BNFT-00010: APPLY BENEFIT LIMITS, COVERED SERVICES, AND EXCLUSIONS.
      * KNOWLEDGE TAG: DOMAIN=BENEFIT CLAIM-TYPE=PROFESSIONAL INSTITUTIONAL PHARMACY.
      * INPUTS: MEMBER, GROUP, PRODUCT, PROVIDER, CLAIM LINE, SERVICE DATE, AMOUNTS.
      * OUTPUTS: STATUS, DENIAL-CODE, PEND-REASON, ALLOWED, PAID, AUDIT MESSAGE.
           IF WS-COVERED-SERVICE-FLAG NOT = 'Y'
              MOVE 'D' TO WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS
              MOVE 'B110' TO WS-DENIAL-CODE
              MOVE 'BENEFIT EXCLUSION OR NON COVERED SERVICE' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT
              PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT
           END-IF.

       AUTH-00011-AUTHORIZATION-RULE.
      * RULE AUTH-00011: CHECK PRIOR AUTHORIZATION AND REFERRAL REQUIREMENTS.
