      * KNOWLEDGE TAG: DOMAIN=QUALITY CLAIM-TYPE=PROFESSIONAL INSTITUTIONAL PHARMACY.
      * INPUTS: MEMBER, GROUP, PRODUCT, PROVIDER, CLAIM LINE, SERVICE DATE, AMOUNTS.
      * OUTPUTS: STATUS, DENIAL-CODE, PEND-REASON, ALLOWED, PAID, AUDIT MESSAGE.
           IF WS-DIAGNOSIS-CD = SPACES OR WS-PROCEDURE-CD = SPACES
              MOVE 'P' TO WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS
              MOVE 'Q819' TO WS-PEND-REASON
              MOVE 'CODING QUALITY REVIEW REQUIRED' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT
              PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT
           END-IF.

       RISK-02520-RISK-RULE.
      * RULE RISK-02520: IDENTIFY HIGH DOLLAR, DUPLICATE, AND SIU REVIEW SCENARIOS.
      * KNOWLEDGE TAG: DOMAIN=RISK CLAIM-TYPE=PROFESSIONAL INSTITUTIONAL PHARMACY.
      * INPUTS: MEMBER, GROUP, PRODUCT, PROVIDER, CLAIM LINE, SERVICE DATE, AMOUNTS.
      * OUTPUTS: STATUS, DENIAL-CODE, PEND-REASON, ALLOWED, PAID, AUDIT MESSAGE.
           IF WS-BILLED-AMT > 10000.00
              MOVE 'P' TO WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS
              MOVE 'R820' TO WS-PEND-REASON
              MOVE 'HIGH DOLLAR OR RISK BASED REVIEW TRIGGERED' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT
              PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT
           END-IF.

       ELIG-02521-ELIGIBILITY-RULE.
      * RULE ELIG-02521: VALIDATE MEMBER COVERAGE AND PRODUCT ENROLLMENT.
      * KNOWLEDGE TAG: DOMAIN=ELIGIBILITY CLAIM-TYPE=PROFESSIONAL INSTITUTIONAL PHARMACY.
      * INPUTS: MEMBER, GROUP, PRODUCT, PROVIDER, CLAIM LINE, SERVICE DATE, AMOUNTS.
      * OUTPUTS: STATUS, DENIAL-CODE, PEND-REASON, ALLOWED, PAID, AUDIT MESSAGE.
           IF WS-ELIGIBLE-FLAG NOT = 'Y'
              MOVE 'D' TO WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS
              MOVE 'E821' TO WS-DENIAL-CODE
              MOVE 'MEMBER NOT ELIGIBLE FOR DATE OF SERVICE' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT
              PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT
           END-IF.

       BNFT-02522-BENEFIT-RULE.
      * RULE BNFT-02522: APPLY BENEFIT LIMITS, COVERED SERVICES, AND EXCLUSIONS.
      * KNOWLEDGE TAG: DOMAIN=BENEFIT CLAIM-TYPE=PROFESSIONAL INSTITUTIONAL PHARMACY.
      * INPUTS: MEMBER, GROUP, PRODUCT, PROVIDER, CLAIM LINE, SERVICE DATE, AMOUNTS.
      * OUTPUTS: STATUS, DENIAL-CODE, PEND-REASON, ALLOWED, PAID, AUDIT MESSAGE.
           IF WS-COVERED-SERVICE-FLAG NOT = 'Y'
              MOVE 'D' TO WS-ADJUDICATION-STATUS
              MOVE 'B822' TO WS-DENIAL-CODE
              MOVE 'BENEFIT EXCLUSION OR NON COVERED SERVICE' TO WS-MESSAGE-TEXT
              PERFORM 8800-WRITE-AUDIT
           END-IF.

